{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Player": 4,
    "大伴": 11,
    "派蒙": 2,
    "莱内": 17
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7269101",
      "subQuestName": "与大伴对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726910101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726910101": {
            "id": "726910101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "#{M#小哥}{F#姑娘}，我看你在这会场上徘徊了很久，应该也是懂得欣赏文艺的风雅之人。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910102"
            ]
          },
          "726910102": {
            "id": "726910102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "现在有件风雅之事想请你帮忙，不知道你意下如何？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910103"
            ]
          },
          "726910103": {
            "id": "726910103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "请讲。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910104"
            ]
          },
          "726910104": {
            "id": "726910104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "我和这位蒙德来的吟游诗人，莱内先生，一见如故。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910105"
            ]
          },
          "726910105": {
            "id": "726910105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "大伴先生说的很对，虽然我和他认识才几天，但他的学识涵养让我非常钦佩。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910106"
            ]
          },
          "726910106": {
            "id": "726910106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "呵呵，莱内先生客气了。总之，我们二人决定以诗会友，趁着这段时间一起创作一些作品。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910107"
            ]
          },
          "726910107": {
            "id": "726910107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "既然风尘仆仆来到了稻妻，那么莱内先生也很想在作品中加入一些有稻妻特色的内容。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910108"
            ]
          },
          "726910108": {
            "id": "726910108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "对，只可惜这次来稻妻的行程太紧，没有时间到处游览采风。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910109"
            ]
          },
          "726910109": {
            "id": "726910109",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "所以，我能做些什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910110"
            ]
          },
          "726910110": {
            "id": "726910110",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "朋友，我正在写一首主题是「乡愁」的诗。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910111"
            ]
          },
          "726910111": {
            "id": "726910111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "游子看到异乡的风景，往往不自觉地回忆起故乡，所以我想在诗里加入一些异乡独有的意象。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910112"
            ]
          },
          "726910112": {
            "id": "726910112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "不知道你能否用留影机拍摄一些画片，帮助我寻找创作灵感呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910113"
            ]
          },
          "726910113": {
            "id": "726910113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "稻妻应该有许多独特的风物吧？比方说，一提到蒙德，大家就会想起「蒲公英」和「风车菊」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910114"
            ]
          },
          "726910114": {
            "id": "726910114",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哦哦，我明白啦，既然这样，去拍摄一些稻妻区域特产的画片就可以了吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910115"
            ]
          },
          "726910115": {
            "id": "726910115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "嗯，那就拜托你们了！我把目前这首创作到一半的诗，也抄一份留给你们做参考。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910116"
            ]
          },
          "726910116": {
            "id": "726910116",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "至于拍摄数量，我想有<color=#00E1FFFF>四张</color>内容不同的画片就差不多了，我也会为你们提供相应的旅费报酬的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910117"
            ]
          },
          "726910117": {
            "id": "726910117",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，既然莱内先生的要求已经都清楚了，那我们就出发吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7269102",
      "subQuestName": "准备四张以稻妻区域特产为主题的画片",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726910201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726910201": {
            "id": "726910201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "是你们啊，画片已经拍好了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910202"
            ]
          },
          "726910202": {
            "id": "726910202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "还没有…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910203"
            ]
          },
          "726910203": {
            "id": "726910203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "拜托了，要<color=#00E1FFFF>四张</color>稻妻区域特产的画片就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7269104",
      "subQuestName": "回复莱内",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726910401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726910401": {
            "id": "726910401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "嗯，紫色是大御所大人的代表色，这两句诗确实很有稻妻的氛围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7269105",
      "subQuestName": "与大伴对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726910901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726910901": {
            "id": "726910901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "#{M#小哥}{F#姑娘}，你的眼光很好啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910902"
            ]
          },
          "726910902": {
            "id": "726910902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "既然大伴先生和这位朋友都很中意这两句，诗句的正式内容就选它吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910903"
            ]
          },
          "726910903": {
            "id": "726910903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "朋友，再次感谢你的帮助！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7269103",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726910301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726910301": {
            "id": "726910301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "是你们啊，画片已经拍好了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910302"
            ]
          },
          "726910302": {
            "id": "726910302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "已经拍好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910303"
            ]
          },
          "726910303": {
            "id": "726910303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "太感谢了。让我看看…果然都是我之前从没见过的物产！噢，这张拍得真不错！这张似乎也很值得一写…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910304"
            ]
          },
          "726910304": {
            "id": "726910304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "朋友，多亏了你们拍摄的画片，我一下子就有了灵感。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910305"
            ]
          },
          "726910305": {
            "id": "726910305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "根据你们提供的画片，我试着写了几种不同的诗句，要使用哪一句，还真是让人为难。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726910306"
            ]
          },
          "726910306": {
            "id": "726910306",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "莱内",
            "text": "我有些好奇你的意见，如果是你会用哪句呢？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7269105",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726910501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726910501": {
            "id": "726910501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "嗯，这两句隐含的意义是「风带来花的芬芳」，和下文也连接得很紧密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7269106",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726910601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726910601": {
            "id": "726910601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "嗯，这两句诗情真意切，氛围也非常空灵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7269107",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726910701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726910701": {
            "id": "726910701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "这两句诗的结构和之前的诗句最接近，朗读起来韵律也不错。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7269108",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726910801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726910801": {
            "id": "726910801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "大伴",
            "text": "这两句诗讨论了时间流逝的得与失，随着时间的流逝，远行之人也领悟到了故乡的意义。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}